flowchart TD
    title Checkout and Payment Flow

    A[Start Checkout] --> B[Select Shipping Address]
    B --> C{Address Valid?}
    C -->|No| D[Add New Address]
    D --> C
    C -->|Yes| E[Select Payment Method]
    E --> F{Payment Type?}
    F -->|Credit Card| G[Enter Card Details]
    F -->|PayPal| H[Redirect to PayPal]
    F -->|Crypto| I[Show Wallet Address]
    G --> J[Validate Card]
    J -->|Invalid| K[Show Card Error]
    J -->|Valid| L[Tokenize Card]
    H --> M[PayPal Auth]
    I --> N[Wait for Confirmation]
    L --> O[Reserve Inventory]
    M --> O
    N --> O
    O --> P{Stock Available?}
    P -->|No| Q[Show "Out of Stock"]
    P -->|Yes| R[Process Payment]
    R --> S{Payment Success?}
    S -->|No| T[Release Inventory]
    T --> U[Show Payment Error]
    S -->|Yes| V[Create Order]
    V --> W[Send Confirmation Email]
    W --> X[Return Order Confirmation]
